    "title": "The Global Burden of Chronic Kidney Disease Attributable to Hypertension in Young Adults From 1990 to 2021 and Projections to 2050",
    "doi": "10.4274/balkanmedj.galenos.2026.2026-1-54111111",
    "received": "2026-01-06",
